Patch for LXC to add lxc.sgids.auto and lxc.sgids.add to the container configuration
file format, to permit precise control of supplementary GIDs in containers.

This patch should be considered preliminary and subject to change.  Once it is
stable, it will be offered back to LXC to form part of the official source tree.

